RESOLUTION NO. __________

ENTITLED: "A RESOLUTION ADOPTING THE CITY OF CHEYENNE 2024
PROGRAM YEAR ANNUAL ACTION PLAN PREPARED BY THE
CHEYENNE HOUSING AND COMMUNITY DEVELOPMENT OFFICE."

WHEREAS, the Department of Housing and Urban Development (HUD) provides
funding to communities to address housing and urban development problems;

WHEREAS, the City of Cheyenne has been designated by HUD as an Entitlement
Community and is eligible to receive an annual allocation of Community Development Block
Grant (CDBG) funds based on the 2020-2024 Comprehensive Consolidated Plan which the
Governing Body adopted on October 12, 2020; and

WHEREAS, the 2024 Program Year Annual Action Plan (Plan) has been developed in
compliance with the City’s Citizen Participation Plan, which requires citizen input and two
public hearings including review and recommendations by the Housing and Community
Development Office Advisory Council.  A copy of the 2024 Annual Action Plan is attached to
this resolution.

NOW, THEREFORE, BE IT RESOLVED BY THE GOVERNING BODY OF THE
CITY OF CHEYENNE, WYOMING, that the 2024 Program Year Annual Action Plan is hereby
adopted.

BE IT FURTHER RESOLVED, that the Mayor is authorized to submit the Plan, along
with certificates, and to execute all HUD contracts and third-party agreements with operating and
sponsoring agents necessary to implement and accomplish the 2024 Program Year Annual
Action Plan.

PRESENTED, READ AND ADOPTED this _______ day of _____________________,
2024.

__________________________________________
Patrick Collins, Mayor

(SEAL)

ATTEST:

____________________________________
