nonprofit agencies to learn about the grant cycle, discuss eligible projects, and view a presentation
about the upcoming grant cycle. The Community Development Manager (CDM) explained that the
anticipated funding allocation was based on the previous year's allocation and was contingent on the
HUD’s allocation notification. The PY24 grant cycle began with a deadline for submitting letters of intent
by October 20, 2023, with five organizations submitting eight letters of intent. The H&CD Advisory
