County Community Partnership, Inc., and the Wyoming Homeless Collaborative aim to address diverse
community needs, prevent service duplication, and promote innovative strategies for community
development. This integrated approach facilitates a comprehensive, efficient, and effective response to
the challenges facing Cheyenne, aligning with the national objectives of the CDBG program.
